  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -IR verb; no spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Past participle: *añadido*",
    "*añadir algo* = to add something (*Añade sal al gusto* — Add salt to taste)",
    "*añadir que* = to add that… (*Añadió que no podía venir* — She added that she couldn't come)",
    "Synonym: *agregar* (slightly more formal in some regions)",
    "Related: *el añadido* = addition; *además* = furthermore, in addition"
